  "created": "2026-11-20T10:48:39.99Z",
  "description": "ExpertPdf PDF Creator is a .NET library to create PDF documents from scratch and to modify existing ones. Add texts, images, graphics, HTML and RTF content, templates, bookmarks, links and attachments, then secure, sign or save the document as PDF/A, tagged PDF or a ZUGFeRD / Factur-X invoice. It includes the complete ExpertPdf HTML to PDF Converter.\n\nThis package contains the library for .NET Framework 2.0 to 4.8.1. It is the build for x86 and AnyCPU applications; for 64-bit applications use ExpertPdf.PdfCreator.x64.\n\nFeatures\n- Create PDF documents from scratch: texts with any font (embedded, Unicode, right to left), images, lines, rectangles, ellipses, Bezier curves and more\n- Add HTML content anywhere in a page (HTML to PDF) with the WebKit, Blink or Chromium rendering engine, and RTF content (RTF to PDF)\n- Templates for headers, footers and watermarks repeated on every page; page numbering\n- Load and modify existing PDF documents; merge and split documents\n- Bookmarks, internal and external links, file attachments, viewer preferences\n- Tagged (accessible) PDF / PDF/UA, PDF/A-1b, PDF/A-2b, PDF/A-3b, PDF/A-3u, PDF/A-3a and PDF/X-1a\n- ZUGFeRD 2.x / Factur-X electronic invoices and associated files (PDF/A-3)\n- Security: user and owner passwords, permissions, 40, 128 and 256 bit encryption; digital signatures\n\nRendering engines\n- WebKit - built in, the default engine.\n- Chromium (Chromium 154) - install ExpertPdf.PdfCreator.Chromium.Windows; Windows; runs in its own process.",
