  "releaseNotes": "Version 22.0: New Chromium rendering engine (Chromium 154) for HTML content, running out of process: the ExpertPdf.PdfCreator.NetCore.Chromium.Windows and ExpertPdf.PdfCreator.Chromium.Windows packages. Blink rendering engine updated to Chromium 148. Tagged (accessible) PDF and PDF/UA-1: Document.Tagged, Language, BeginTag / EndTag, PdfTagType, alternate and actual text, artifacts. PDF/A-2b, PDF/A-3b, PDF/A-3u and PDF/A-3a; associated files (Document.AddAssociatedFile). ZUGFeRD 2.x / Factur-X electronic invoices: Document.AddZugferdInvoice. New HTML conversion options: HttpPostParameters, SecureProtocol, RenderElementSelector, WindowStatus, EnableOfflineMode, WebGlEnabled, AllowContentHeightResize. HTML content continues across pages with the Chromium engine; ManagedContentTrimming and MaxConversionTime on HtmlToPdfElement. Table of contents with page numbers and links (Document.InsertTableOfContents), page labels and named destinations.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "summary": "PDF library for .NET: create, edit, merge and split PDF documents with text, images, shapes, HTML and RTF content.",
